{'symbol': 'HST', 'date': '2023-01-04 16:30:00', 'title': 'HOST HOTELS & RESORTS COMPLETES $2.5 BILLION SUSTAINABILITY-LINKED CREDIT FACILITY REFINANCING, MAINTAINS PRICING', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD., JAN. 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HOST HOTELS & RESORTS, INC. (NASDAQ: HST), THE NATION'S LARGEST LODGING REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST (THE “COMPANY”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT AMENDED AND RESTATED ITS EXISTING $2.5 BILLION CREDIT FACILITY (THE “AGREEMENT”)."}